r mysteries within a certain mansion. Each time the cycle repeats, the story changes, and Velvet holds memories of being both the victim and the perpetrator. Because of this, she sees herself as eternally bloodstained and diligently cleans every day. She's a bright girl who never stops smiling, but her eyes are always empty... Please draw her in this outfit: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Tuj-PTq20g2uD6gpenkYZkPMZdkwvD_x\n\nCharacter Motifs: ・Amaranth and Keman-sou flowers ・The underachieving hound: A maid who strives desperately for praise, sometimes baring her fangs ・Hunger/Meals: An endless cycle of eating and being eaten, killing and being killed... ・Sweets: Sweet treats, cakes, strawberry jam... She craves (loving) sweet rewards more than bloody murder\n・Puppet: Thinks of herself as a doll rather than a person Notes (Please remember to include these points!) ・Red gloves (never removed) ・Bruises on palms and soles ・Nails are naturally red, not painted ・Freckles don't need to be exact replicas, but please include those on her forehead and neck! Considering the above settings and notes, I'll leave the composition and poses up to you!\nI'd be thrilled if you'd consider it ( ´ ▽ ` )♡ https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PtxYwMWbLHEuIPS91qLr95f3ePugFJz2?usp=drive_link", "nc": 25, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@hfdayo/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2023098, "client_id": 3419276, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ebbed8d4/uploads/origins/c766f110-2332-413e-9ebf-b43b111acd0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf02bc85276983521d1b791a0ecf66e9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ebbed8d4/uploads/origins/c766f110-2332-413e-9ebf-b43b111acd0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf02bc85276983521d1b791a0ecf66e9, h