qT-AodWd5u4SyTzCv", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@hfdayo/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2023098, "client_id": 293143, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88363c7c/uploads/origins/dbb0393a-8df1-4fc0-b178-dcf5ac1b84dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89e11ca611064216d713f9fdea75cc96", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88363c7c/uploads/origins/dbb0393a-8df1-4fc0-b178-dcf5ac1b84dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89e11ca611064216d713f9fdea75cc96, https://si.imgix.net/88363c7c/uploads/origins/dbb0393a-8df1-4fc0-b178-dcf5ac1b84dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29785d410fbfd45744555fd22dc0c0c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88363c7c/uploads/origins/dbb0393a-8df1-4fc0-b178-dcf5ac1b84dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2577a8e2729ec17030b63de9f8738c5b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88363c7c/uploads/origins/dbb0393a-8df1-4fc0-b178-dcf5ac1b84dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb54a32657a495479b0e10f9415ccfb8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88363c7c/uploads/origins/dbb0393a-8df1-4fc0-b178-dcf5ac1b84dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb54a32657a495479b0e10f9415ccfb8, https://si.imgix.net/88363c7c/uploads/origins/dbb0393a-8df1-4fc0-b178-dcf5ac1b84dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=31b3c30756de1b3805bc00657e8cad22 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88363c7c/uploads/origins/dbb0393a-8df1-4fc0-b178-dcf5ac1b84dd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=14fd3141910913be25abadc64fd4d0b5 3x"}, "body": "Hello, dada-sensei. I love your illustrations with their three-dimensionality, sense of composition, and color scheme.\n\nI would like to make a request for my original yuri cp (Rui and Naki Riva) if you don't mind. The world is like Harima without magic, or Europe with a messed up sense of time, but please feel free to use your own sense of arrangement, situations, costumes, intertwining, deformation, concept, format, etc.\n\n  I may use your illustrations for my own use in a minimum lot of goods. We will not sell them or use them for commercial purposes.\n\n  https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-3RLQmr5d29e-ndrnfmpXnYOlDGST1DE", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@hfdayo/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2023098, "client_id": 1952854, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7cb4c66f/uploads/origins/0a6a7b7d-0c61-4603-9f74-1d9fd642096a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb4db268667d7b85038708bb65f1dd52", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7cb4c66f/uploads/origins/0a6a7b7d-0c61-4603-9f74-1d9fd642096a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb4db268667d7b85038708bb65f1dd52, https://si.imgix.net/7cb4c66f/uploads/origins/0a6a7b7d-0c61-4603-9f74-1d9fd642096a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a8e639ca37e54abb28575da711a9908 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7cb4c66f/uploads/origins/0a6a7b7d-0c61-4603-9f74-1d9fd642096a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a2a7c615d1046d878be76f2877fbcde 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7cb4c66f/uploads/origins/0a6a7b7d-0c61-4603-9f74-1d9fd642096a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a88f21853930a687b58076486a6bb883", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7cb4c66f/uploads/origins/0a6a7b7d-0c61-4603-9f74-1d9fd642096a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a88f21853930a687b58076486a6bb883, https://si.imgix.net/7cb4c66f/uploads/origins/0a6a7b7d-0c61-4603-9f74-1d9fd642096a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=754e6fcc0d89d7fceb9113857c324769 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7cb4c66f/uploads/origins/0a6a7b7d-0c61-4603-9f74-1d9fd642096a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8b709b6be1c921857b3b6e9b9e69f071 3x"}, "body": "dadaさん、はじめまして。いつも魅力的なイラストを拝見させていただいております。この度は是非dadaさんの絵柄でOCを拝見したくリクエストをお送りさせていただきました。\n使用用途としては、ヘッダー、アイコンへの個人利用と鑑賞になります。\n\n希望等は特に無くdadaさんの描かれるイラストの雰囲気やデザインが大好きなのでご自由に描いていただけますと嬉しいです。\n\nもしよろしければご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12-C9MfVqeFVwD90rddthlClSmk9bX2_j", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@hfdayo/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2023098, "client_id": 2526411, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f631cf3d/uploads/origins/d36cfd34-f3df-46ce-ad6d-cfc4d067e1cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f61811ca631a0635ba4f655cd734876f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f631cf3d/uploads/origins/d36cfd34-f3df-46ce-ad6d-cfc4d067e1cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f61811ca631a0635ba4f655cd734876f, https://si.imgix.net/f631cf3d/uploads/origins/d36cfd34-f3df-46ce-ad6d-cfc4d067e1cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47495a968210397c16b5c3a5e7c22ac9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f631cf3d/uploads/origins/d36cfd34-f3df-46ce-ad6d-cfc4d067e1cb?bg=%23fff&auto=for