YCD4k5RZdEEiEGbUIm\n\nI really like the atmosphere of dada's illustrations, and I'm fine leaving the composition, etc. to you, I'd be happy to draw it however you like💓Thank you!\n\nI would like to use it for\nSNS icons, etc.\nI will not use it for commercial purposes.\n\n That is all. We apologize for the inconvenience, but we would appreciate your consideration. Thank you very much.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 881, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "みるお", "screen_name": "milleoxox", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1225312996622159872/2us1U7__.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2775804750/1607276190/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 129}, {"id": 993611, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "おれあず", "screen_name": "oreazu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1991916652305522688/k5s2UmXv.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/915374295219560448/1698288038/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 1548718, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "蓮", "screen_name": "_0318REN_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1877382467491155968/3HVYs9hz.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1212031914845933568/174576824